# The console's .js is emitted from .ts by esbuild (scripts/build_ts.mjs,
# TYPING.md) and committed so the addon installs with no node toolchain.
# It is real, reviewable output -- not minified, not bundled -- but the
# .ts next to it is what changes hands-on; mark it for tools that care
# (diff collapsing, blame, GitHub's language stats).
#
# Named per file, not by a directory glob: most of `console/` is still
# hand-authored .js (TYPING.md Phase 2b converts it leaf-first), and
# marking an entire directory generated before it actually is would be
# false for every file not yet converted. Add a line here in the same PR
# that converts a file's .ts, drop it if a file is ever converted back.
app_builder_view/static/src/console/compat.js linguist-generated
app_builder_view/static/src/console/geometry.js linguist-generated
app_builder_view/static/src/console/identity.js linguist-generated
app_builder_view/static/src/console/types.js linguist-generated
